Emerald 3DS changes to pret/pokeemerald 76463dac15cad36aca5e2b3f6366abf9e53f814f: Korean Easy Chat keyboard
Applies after 0068-korean-ui-layout.patch; apply with tools/bootstrap.py.

Korean build only (GAME_LANGUAGE == LANGUAGE_KOREAN), as the Korean ROM: the
alphabet keyboard lists the initial consonants (ㄱ to ㅎ) and Others on three rows,
with its column positions and cursor offsets. tools/localize_korean.py writes the
word lists of these 20 groups (easy_chat_words_by_letter.h) from the player's ROM.

